so I don’t really consider them spoilery.

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:52.070
I’ll wait just a sec...okay.

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:53.760
Here we go

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:54.890
1- nicnacz.

00:00:54.890 --> 00:00:56.880
Was Seth Gilliam’s Character already introduced?

00:00:56.880 --> 00:00:59.540
Who is he and what’s his connection to Rick’s
Group?

00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:03.699
Yes, they introduced him officially at Comic
Con as Father Gabriel from the comics.

00:01:03.699 --> 00:01:07.680
He’s playing a comic book character but
that doesn’t mean he’ll be exactly like

00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:09.250
father gabriel in the comics.

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:11.110
You guys know the drill with that.

00:01:11.110 --> 00:01:17.830
Of all the brand new characters, he’s one
of the two I’m most excited to see.

00:01:17.830 --> 00:01:22.150
I love Seth Gilliam and based on the types
of characters he’s been playing more recently,

00:01:22.150 --> 00:01:23.150
like on Teen Wolf.

00:01:23.150 --> 00:01:27.350
I’m interested to see how he handles spirituality
inside the Walking Dead Universe.

00:01:27.350 --> 00:01:31.710
His Teen Wolf character is also this soft
spoken mystical healer, so of course they’d

00:01:31.710 --> 00:01:33.730
cast him as a religious figure.

00:01:33.730 --> 00:01:36.920
Even if he weren’t a man of god, he would
still probably have come off as the spiritual

00:01:36.920 --> 00:01:37.920
one.

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:42.060
The other big character I’m really interested
in right now is this crazy looking policewoman

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:44.240
smacking Beth around.

00:01:44.240 --> 00:01:47.310
Right now I’m thinking of her as Lady Negan,
but that’s not who she is.

00:01:47.310 --> 00:02:03.110
They didn’t genderbend that character from
the comics.

00:02:03.110 --> 00:02:06.840
2 - Cameren Ceniceros.

00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:10.390
How do you think they’ll give significant
screen time to each character this season.

00:02:10.390 --> 00:02:15.580
There was one point in the trailer when there
was over a dozen on screen at the same time.

00:02:15.580 --> 00:02:16.730
The short answer is they won’t.

00:02:16.730 --> 00:02:21.040
They’ll just pick three or four characters
that will get solo type episodes like in season

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:22.040
4.

00:02:22.040 --> 00:02:24.380
And the rest of the characters will just get
moments during the group scenes.

00:02:24.380 --> 00:02:26.030
And when I say solo episodes.

00:02:26.030 --> 00:02:28.790
I don’t mean they’ll go off on their own.

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:33.950
I just mean the majority of the scenes in
certain episodes will focus on the biggest

00:02:33.950 --> 00:02:35.680
handful of characters.

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:36.840
Beth is the one exception this year.

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:38.950
She’ll get a lot more screentime in that
messed up looking hospital place.

00:02:38.950 --> 00:02:41.349
We don’t know where that is yet.

00:02:41.349 --> 00:02:46.510
But it seems like she’ll be there for the
entire first half of the season.

00:02:46.510 --> 00:02:48.780
3 - Neto De Toro.

00:02:48.780 --> 00:02:54.060
I’ll never understand why it’s okay to
have zombies with exploding heads but they

00:02:54.060 --> 00:02:55.060
can’t drop f-bombs?

00:02:55.060 --> 00:02:59.650
This is a weird standards and practices thing,
at least in the United States.

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:02.810
Each country deals with censorship in a slightly
different way.

00:03:02.810 --> 00:03:06.140
Standards and Practices are people that work
inside the networks and try to avoid shows

00:03:06.140 --> 00:03:11.360
getting fined by the FCC.

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:15.360
So if they think the FCC will complain about
the use of a word, or a certain level of voilence

00:03:15.360 --> 00:03:16.360
or sex.

00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:17.680
They’ll ask the showrunner, in this case,
scott gimple.

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:18.959
To remove or edit something out.

00:03:18.959 --> 00:03:20.720
There is no logic to it.

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:24.500
What passes for okay changes every year, sometimes
it gets even more strict in later seasons

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:25.500
for no apparent reason.

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:26.500
The DVD is the exception.

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:29.260
AMC can slap a warning label on it to avoid
potential fines and they can leave everything

00:03:29.260 --> 00:03:30.260
in.

00:03:30.260 --> 00:03:35.110
It’s the same deal with the way movies get
rated in the United States.

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:36.930
4 - Gab Borja.

00:03:36.930 --> 00:03:40.129
Do you think *spoiler’s Hand will be cut
off in season 5?

00:03:40.129 --> 00:03:43.170
I just omitted the name because most people
should already know who this is you’re asking

00:03:43.170 --> 00:03:44.170
about.

00:03:44.170 --> 00:03:49.732
I do not think his hand will be chopped off,
although they have joked about it at conventions.

00:03:49.732 --> 00:03:53.541
There is a major character in the comics that
loses a hand, but the show hasn’t done it

00:03:53.541 --> 00:03:54.541
yet.

00:03:54.541 --> 00:03:58.930
Recently Norman Reedus tweeted a picture of
a chopped off hand with a ring on it.

00:03:58.930 --> 00:04:06.760
What I think really happened was they cut
off a random person’s hand as a way to wink

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:07.760
at the comic book fans.

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:13.140
I don’t think that person was the big character
everyone thinks it is.

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:14.140
He’ll probably be fine.

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:17.310
Why not you ask?

00:04:17.310 --> 00:04:18.840
Mostly for sake of practicality.

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:24.069
It’s expensive and extremely time consuming
to apply prosthetics for a missing hand, along

00:04:24.069 --> 00:04:26.099
with creating the digital effects to support
it.

00:04:26.099 --> 00:04:30.050
So it makes filming with that character way
more expensive over time.

00:04:30.050 --> 00:04:33.750
And even though Walking Dead makes a crap
ton of money, it’s the most profitable show

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:35.779
on cable right now next to Big Bang Theory.

00:04:35.779 --> 00:04:38.440
It’s also one of the most expensive shows.

00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:48.930
AMC spends more making walking dead than HBO
spends 

00:04:48.930 --> 00:04:56.169
making Game of Thrones.

00:04:56.169 --> 00:05:00.259
5 - Darcy Peterson.

00:05:00.259 --> 00:05:01.740
During the governor’s attack on the prison.

00:05:01.740 --> 00:05:05.470
Do you think he would have really let the
survivors leave the prison unharmed if they

00:05:05.470 --> 00:05:07.240
chose to give it up?

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:12.750
I don’t think he knew what he was going
to do till it all started going down.

00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:16.759
I think he’d really only thought through
it up to the point of the megaphone and the

00:05:16.759 --> 00:05:17.759
threats.

00:05:17.759 --> 00:05:20.749
And then something inside him just snapped
while Rick was trying to reason with him.

00:05:20.749 --> 00:05:26.139
Had the survivors chosen to go he would have
eventually found a reason to go after them.

00:05:26.139 --> 00:05:29.699
I also think the prison would have turned
into another Woodbury.

00:05:29.699 --> 00:05:33.310
So either way, the governor would have ended
up going crazy again and killing a bunch of

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:36.879
people.

00:05:36.879 --> 00:05:44.029
6 - jgcujo.

00:05:44.029 --> 00:05:48.160
Everyone has been talking about Daryl’s
character maybe being gay, do you think he

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:49.160
is?

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:51.710
Is there something going on between him and
carol?

00:05:51.710 --> 00:05:56.930
I saw this, I’m not sure why people thought
he might be gay.

00:05:56.930 --> 00:06:03.149
It is okay for a man to not try to have sex
with every woman that passes his field of

00:06:03.149 --> 00:06:06.389
vision.

00:06:06.389 --> 00:06:23.249
Maybe it was because of his lack of sexual
relationships since the apocalypse started.

00:06:23.249 --> 00:06:27.240
Daryl never really struck me as a ladies man,
but I don’t think he’s gay.

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:31.839
I think he’s got an undiagnosed personality
disorder that causes him to recoil a little

00:06:31.839 --> 00:06:34.020
from the thought of intimacy.

00:06:34.020 --> 00:06:36.210
Just to clarify, I don’t think he’s asexual.

00:06:36.210 --> 00:06:40.189
That’s like the absence of sexual feelings
under normal circumstances.

00:06:40.189 --> 00:06:44.840
For the last 4 years or so, Daryl has been
living in a wasteland of death, so no one

00:06:44.840 --> 00:06:45.840
is thinking normally.

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:49.240
He’s just now starting to think of the survivors
as his real family.

00:06:49.240 --> 00:06:56.289
So I think what we’ll see is him opening
up to people.

00:06:56.289 --> 00:07:00.689
If that continues, the natural progression
would be for him to develop a more intimate

00:07:00.689 --> 00:07:03.839
relationship if the opportunity presented
itself.

00:07:03.839 --> 00:07:04.999
I know there’s some Carol/Daryl shipping,
but I think neither one of them is looking

00:07:04.999 --> 00:07:06.710
for that kind of a relationship right now.

00:07:06.710 --> 00:07:09.169
What we might see in a future season is a
guest character come on and Daryl get close

00:07:09.169 --> 00:07:10.169
with her.

00:07:10.169 --> 00:07:11.210
But Scott Gimple has said that at no time
in season 5 will they address Daryl’s sexuality.

00:07:11.210 --> 00:07:12.569
It’s just not something they think is interesting.

00:07:12.569 --> 00:07:13.569
From a storytelling perspective.

00:07:13.569 --> 00:07:14.569
7- Ciaran McFadden.

00:07:14.569 --> 00:07:57.479
Do you think they’ll kill off a main character
like Daryl or Glenn?

00:07:57.479 --> 00:08:03.059
Neither one of them is completely untouchable,
but I don’t see them getting rid of Daryl

00:08:03.059 --> 00:08:06.120
he’s one of their most popular characters.

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:14.139
The next main character to die will probably
be one of the smaller ones.

00:08:14.139 --> 00:08:17.639
There have been a lot of Glenn Rumors, I don’t
know if there’s any truth there.

00:08:17.639 --> 00:08:23.379
But I’ve heard everything from Maggie Pregnancy
to Baseball bats.

00:08:23.379 --> 00:08:36.260
I wouldn’t be surprised if Bob died though,
it feels like they’d give him a big hero

00:08:36.260 --> 00:08:39.370
moment to prove to himself he wasn’t terrible.

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:41.640
And then right away a bunch of walkers would
swarm him.

00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:42.960
So he could die a hero.

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:47.830
Instead of just being an alcoholic.

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:53.440
8 - Frazer Chard.

00:08:53.440 --> 00:08:58.650
Is there any truth to the statement that Robert
Kirkman wants the show to run for 12 seasons?

00:08:58.650 --> 00:09:03.130
Every Time I’ve heard Kirkman talk about
the series, first he’s said he’ll keep

00:09:03.130 --> 00:09:06.090
writing the comics till no one buys them anymore,
which is basically forever.

00:09:06.090 --> 00:09:10.460
And It’s almost the same situation for the
tv series.

00:09:10.460 --> 00:09:15.160
Because tv is so much harder to produce than
a comic, eventually the show will become to

00:09:15.160 --> 00:09:16.720
expensive to produce.

00:09:16.720 --> 00:09:18.990
That’s what the spin off is for.

00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:25.350
A way to continue the show, without having
to pay crazy extra money for season 20.

00:09:25.350 --> 00:09:33.270
Actors salaries at that point would be in
the millions of dollars.

00:09:33.270 --> 00:09:35.680
9 - braders.

00:09:35.680 --> 00:09:37.420
Are you sponsored by Razer now?

00:09:37.420 --> 00:09:40.440
I’ve been seeing that razer headset a lot.

00:09:40.440 --> 00:09:43.560
That’s funny, no.

00:09:43.560 --> 00:09:45.020
I just wanted some more color in my background.

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:48.350
I have these grey sound panels on the wall
and it looks kind of dull.

00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:49.760
I wish I had a sponsorship.

00:09:49.760 --> 00:09:52.630
Right now no one is paying me to do anything.

00:09:52.630 --> 00:09:58.020
So anytime you see something in a video or
I mention something it’s just because that’s

00:09:58.020 --> 00:09:59.860
what I’m thinking about at that moment.

00:09:59.860 --> 00:10:03.490
I will say, product related stuff might be
happening in the next year.

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:04.890
But I don’t know when.

00:10:04.890 --> 00:10:08.590
If there’s ever something I think you guys
will really enjoy and the opportunity comes

00:10:08.590 --> 00:10:10.590
up then I’d do something like that.

00:10:10.590 --> 00:10:13.620
But generally I don’t expect anything like
that to happen anytime soon.

00:10:13.620 --> 00:10:14.620
Whenever brands go after creators it’s usually
fashion and cosmetics companies.

00:10:14.620 --> 00:10:16.640
Even Pewdie Pie doesn’t do a lot of straight
up ads.

00:10:16.640 --> 00:10:20.640
He does integrations with like Humble Bundle
and other services like that.

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:21.770
Like giving out discount codes.

00:10:21.770 --> 00:10:23.240
That’s a little less invasive.

00:10:23.240 --> 00:10:25.267
Ad stuff is like a whole different part of
being a youtuber that I’m starting to learn

00:10:25.267 --> 00:10:26.267
about.

00:10:26.267 --> 00:10:27.267
Most of my experience working on the platform
is just making content.

00:10:27.267 --> 00:10:29.190
The business side of it is a whole different
group of people.

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:30.330
So I try not to worry about that stuff.

00:10:30.330 --> 00:10:32.230
10 - drake henderson-dumont.

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:34.390
How do you think the tv show will end?

00:10:34.390 --> 00:10:41.580
Will Rick ever die?

00:10:41.580 --> 00:10:46.710
I think they’ll end it in some ambiguous
way where one or a couple of the characters

00:10:46.710 --> 00:10:48.930
just keep traveling around trying to survive.

00:10:48.930 --> 00:10:56.240
They’ll leave it in a way that lets you
know that things in general will just continue.

00:10:56.240 --> 00:10:58.590
I do think by the end several of the characters
will be dead, it’s a really big cast.

00:10:58.590 --> 00:11:01.470
It would be disingenuous if everyone got to
live for 12 seasons.

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:05.160
I’d like to see Beth and maybe Carl amongst
the last people standing.

00:11:05.160 --> 00:11:07.680
That would be one of the less depressing endings.

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:11.810
If you wanted it to be super hardcore you’d
kill everyone else and let Rick survive.

00:11:11.810 --> 00:11:15.830
I don’t think Rick wants to live if it means
everyone he cares about is dead.

00:11:15.830 --> 00:11:18.690
That’s kind of what happened to the governor.

